{
  "movie_id": 513400101,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 12.9,
      "end_time": 16.7,
      "text": "Sorry for making you help us out with odd jobs at year-end"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 17.2,
      "end_time": 19.1,
      "text": "We'll be sure to reward you properly"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 19.4,
      "end_time": 23.1,
      "text": "I also helped out, give me one too"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 23.3,
      "end_time": 26.0,
      "text": "Naturally, we'll reward you too"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 26.6,
      "end_time": 27.9,
      "text": "...Also, Assistant-kun"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 28.1,
      "end_time": 31.5,
      "text": "Did you notice anything when seeing my figure?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 31.6,
      "end_time": 32.4,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 43.7,
      "end_time": 44.4,
      "text": "Cute"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 44.7,
      "end_time": 45.6,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 46.5,
      "end_time": 47.6,
      "text": "Ehem..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 47.8,
      "end_time": 52.6,
      "text": "I-I prepared this to help me tail more effectively alongside the new year crowds"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 54.0,
      "end_time": 57.6,
      "text": "If you want to, do you want to help me test out its effectiveness?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 58.4,
      "end_time": 60.4,
      "text": "In other words, have our first shrine visit toge..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 60.6,
      "end_time": 61.5,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 63.5,
      "end_time": 64.6,
      "text": "Uwaaah!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 65.6,
      "end_time": 67.0,
      "text": "Are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 67.5,
      "end_time": 71.4,
      "text": "Weeh～... I rushed too much and \nmessed up my teleportation～..."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 71.6,
      "end_time": 75.5,
      "text": "Umm, who might you be?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 76.0,
      "end_time": 77.6,
      "text": "It's Hatsune-san!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 77.9,
      "end_time": 79.4,
      "text": "You know, Shiori-san's big sister...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 80.0,
      "end_time": 83.3,
      "text": "Teleportation magic on a gang raid would be wild to think of."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 84.2,
      "end_time": 86.4,
      "text": "S-Sorry for coming out of nowhere!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 86.6,
      "end_time": 89.5,
      "text": "But I have something I have to tell him!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 89.7,
      "end_time": 92.5,
      "text": "That said, Hatsune-san is also..."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 97.2,
      "end_time": 98.2,
      "text": "Cute"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 98.4,
      "end_time": 101.1,
      "text": "Seriously!? You know that this kimono is very recommended!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 101.3,
      "end_time": 103.2,
      "text": "Hatsune-chan is very impressed～☆"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 103.4,
      "end_time": 107.5,
      "text": "You don't need to be that excited, he'll say that to anyone"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 108.1,
      "end_time": 109.1,
      "text": "Everyone is cute"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 110.6,
      "end_time": 112.6,
      "text": "Well, I thought it was something like that"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 113.2,
      "end_time": 115.5,
      "text": "So, why are you here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 115.7,
      "end_time": 118.5,
      "text": "Wah! I was too happy that I almost forgot!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 119.1,
      "end_time": 120.9,
      "text": "It's a major incident! A very major one!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 121.1,
      "end_time": 124.5,
      "text": "You don't have to panic, you can consult us about it"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 125.1,
      "end_time": 125.8,
      "text": "Really!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 126.0,
      "end_time": 130.1,
      "text": "Kasumin is smart so that's a huge help～"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 130.6,
      "end_time": 132.6,
      "text": "You can relax now that I'm handling it"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 133.2,
      "end_time": 135.1,
      "text": "So, what's the incident in question?"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 137.6,
      "end_time": 140.1,
      "text": "A meteorite this big"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 140.3,
      "end_time": 142.5,
      "text": "Will soon crash on Landosol～!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 144.2,
      "end_time": 145.5,
      "text": "?"
    }
  ],
